      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "stageId": "G04A",
        "role": "field",
        "field": "change"
      },
      "text": "临时原型已创建 pyproject.toml、uv.lock、sdk_probe.py、transport_probe.py、report.py、report\n.json。SDK 4.17＋OTel 1.45 可解析；生产选择同一 tracing.py 内的私有 OTel＋隔离 HTTP 进程\n。",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "临时原型已创建 pyproject.toml、uv.lock、sdk_probe.py、transport_probe.py、report.py、report\n.json。SDK 4.17＋OTel 1.45 可解析；生产选择同一 tracing.py 内的私有 OTel＋隔离 HTTP 进程\n。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.28
